cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "AnesLLM benchmark: evaluating LLMs on real intraoperative anesthesia decisions"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark that asks language models to choose the next anesthetic adjustment
  (hypnotic / opioid / no action) in real intraoperative situations derived from
  VitalDB, and compares their choices with the actions anesthesiologists actually
  took.
